<title>UK: BT consortium in Singapore telecom bid.</title>
<headline>BT consortium in Singapore telecom bid.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Telecommunications Plc said on Thursday that it is part of a consortium bidding for Singapore's second telecommunications licence.</p>
<p>The consortium includes Japan's Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp, Singapore Technologies Telemedia and Singapore Power.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
